WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.446
PostgreSQL has an optional crosstab function through
the tablefunc extension It

00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:12.011
can create pivot tables but it requires extension
support and explicit output-column definitions

00:00:13.743 --> 00:00:18.650
For this course conditional aggregation is the core
pattern because it is transparent and works

00:00:18.677 --> 00:00:24.461
well in the browser environment You can explore
crosstab later for selected

00:00:24.487 --> 00:00:25.829
reporting scenarios
